      <section class="about" aria-label="About Junha Ham">
        <div class="intro-text">
        <p>Hi! I am Junha Ham, an undergraduate at <a href="https://en.snu.ac.kr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Seoul National University</a>, studying Computer Science and Engineering and Economics. I am an undergraduate researcher at the Causality Lab, advised by <a href="https://www.sanghacklee.me/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Prof. Sanghack Lee</a>.</p>
        <p>My research focuses on causal machine learning, particularly causal foundation models and probabilistic inference. I am also interested in world models and robot learning and perception.</p>
        <p>Previously, I worked with <a href="https://econ.snu.ac.kr/people/faculty?mode=view&amp;profidx=22" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Prof. Jungmin Lee</a> on labor and education data.</p>
        <p class="contact-links">
          <a href="mailto:__EMAIL__" aria-label="Email Junha Ham" title="Email">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m3 6 9 7 9-7"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="assets/pdf/Junha_Ham_CV.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="View CV (PDF)" title="CV (PDF)">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14 3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9Z"/><path d="M14 3v6h6"/><text x="12" y="17.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="7" font-weight="700">CV</text></svg>
